{"channelId":"UC7LeHzjVuIOrExEf6FrOlLQ","row":["Big Little Life Animal Rescue",649,"Big Little Life Animal Rescue is a volunteer-run 501(c)(3) nonprofit dedicated to giving abandoned, injured, and forgotten dogs a second chance.\n\nEvery video on this channel is part of a real rescue story.\nSome of these dogs arrive starving, sick, or badly injured. Some have spent years on chains. Some have never known kindness at all. \nWe share their journeys exactly as they happen, from emergency rescues and veterinary care to recovery, adoption, and the quiet moments that remind us why we keep going.\nNot every story has a happy ending. But every dog deserves someone to fight for them.\nIf you've ever wondered whether one person can make a difference, you're in the right place.\n\nThank you for being here, for watching, for sharing these stories, and for helping us change lives, one dog at a time. ❤️","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7LeHzjVuIOrExEf6FrOlLQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7LeHzjVuIOrExEf6FrOlLQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:49.372Z","channelId":"UC7LeHzjVuIOrExEf6FrOlLQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"7cb73f387f0194aa019613f84bdbad2dc9f83cbd1870bfbc497ce518a10d6765","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"7ce8a79fb6e042743731f4297b210b236c23c55528ff0193b1896869483ac025"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7LeHzjVuIOrExEf6FrOlLQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:49.372Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7LeHzjVuIOrExEf6FrOlLQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":649,"raw":"649 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7LeHzjVuIOrExEf6FrOlLQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:49.372Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profi